  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "New magnet APIs: preview a magnet's file list before downloading (GetMagnetMetadataAsync, AddTorrentOptions.StopAfterMetadata, ITorrent.WaitForMetadataAsync) and export/cache metadata to skip re-downloading it (ITorrent.ExportTorrentFile). BEP 53: magnet URI file selection (so=). BEP 47: full support for file attributes, symlinks, and per-file SHA-1 in v1/v2/hybrid torrents. Storage reliability: write/read failures now surface instead of being swallowed - disk-full or a permanently failed file stops the torrent with an error instead of re-downloading pieces forever or serving zero-filled data that gets the client banned. Duplicate peer connections are deduplicated by endpoint and peer id, and failed handshakes close the incomplete peer. Hardening: UDP receive-loop backoff on persistent socket errors, uTP connect cancellation fixes, NAT-PMP receive timeout fix, PeerManager decomposition, and eight correctness/security fixes across DHT, blocklist, cache, and trackers.",
